<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine wheat up on export demand.</title>
<headline>Argentine wheat up on export demand.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentine wheat was up on export demand at the Buenos Aires Cereals Exchange, traders said.</p>
<p>Buenos Aires wheat for April delivery rose $2 to 144. Maize was also bolstered by demand by exporters, with Buenos Aires wheat for April delivery rising $2 to 110. Sunseed followed foreign markets while soybeans were also boosted by sales abroad. Rosario soybeans were up $8 at 303.</p>
<p>((--Buenos Aires Newsroom, 541 318-0668))</p>
